# Data Flow

> **Mermaid diagram:** Key data paths through the system

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Read Paths"
        A1[Catalog Page] --> A2[GET /api/products]
        A2 --> A3[Supabase: products table]
        A3 --> A4[RLS: public products]
        
        B1[Product Detail] --> B2[GET /api/products/[slug]]
        B2 --> B3[Supabase: products + umkm]
        
        C1[Order Detail] --> C2[GET /api/orders/[code]]
        C2 --> C3[Supabase: orders table]
        C3 --> C4[RLS: buyer/seller/admin]
        
        D1[Seller Dashboard] --> D2[GET /api/seller/*]
        D2 --> D3[Supabase: products, orders, umkm]
        
        E1[Admin Dashboard] --> E2[GET /api/admin/*]
        E2 --> E3[Supabase: all tables]
        E3 -.->|Service Role| E4[RLS Bypassed]
    end

    subgraph "Write Paths"
        F1[Checkout] --> F2[POST /api/checkout/xendit]
        F2 --> F3[Supabase: INSERT orders]
        F3 --> F4[RPC: reserve_stock_for_order]
        F2 --> F5[Xendit: Create Invoice]
        
        G1[Xendit Webhook] --> G2[POST /api/webhooks/xendit]
        G2 --> G3[Supabase: UPDATE orders]
        G3 --> G4[RPC: settle_order_paid]
        G2 --> G5[Biteship: Create Shipment]
        
        H1[Biteship Webhook] --> H2[POST /api/webhooks/biteship]
        H2 --> H3[Supabase: UPDATE orders]
        H3 --> H4[RPC: settle_order_completed]
        
        I1[Seller Actions] --> I2[PATCH /api/seller/orders/[code]]
        I2 --> I3[Supabase: UPDATE orders]
        
        J1[Admin Actions] --> J2[PATCH /api/admin/*]
        J2 -.->|Service Role| J3[Supabase: UPDATE/DELETE any]
    end

    subgraph "Realtime"
        K1[Orders Table] --> K2[Supabase Realtime]
        K2 --> K3[Buyer: order updates]
        K2 --> K4[Seller: order updates]
        
        L1[Chat Table] --> L2[Supabase Realtime]
        L2 --> L3[Courier: messages]
        L2 --> L4[Buyer/Seller: messages]
        
        M1[Courier Location] --> M2[Supabase Realtime]
        M2 --> M3[Buyer: live tracking]
    end

    style F1 fill:#FFEB3B,color:#000
    style G1 fill:#FF9800,color:#000
    style H1 fill:#FF9800,color:#000
    style E4 fill:#FF5252,color:#fff
    style J3 fill:#FF5252,color:#fff
```

