## Data Flow: Checkout

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant DB
    participant Xendit

    Client->>API: POST /checkout/xendit {productSlug, qty, fulfillment}
    API->>DB: SELECT product (stock, price, schedule)
    DB-->>API: Product data
    API->>DB: RPC reserve_stock_for_order
    DB-->>API: { reserved: true, marker_id }
    API->>Xendit: POST /v2/invoices
    Xendit-->>API: { invoice_url, id }
    API->>DB: INSERT order (payment=unpaid, invoice_state=pending)
    DB-->>API: order_code
    API-->>Client: { order_code, invoice_url }
    Client->>Xendit: User pays
    Xendit->>API: Webhook /api/webhooks/xendit
    API->>DB: UPDATE order (payment=paid, invoice_state=paid)
    API->>DB: RPC settle_order_paid
    API->>Biteship: Create shipment (if delivery)
```

