## Data Flow: Courier Tracking

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Courier
    participant App
    participant DB
    participant Buyer

    Courier->>App: POST /api/courier/location {lat, lng}
    App->>DB: UPDATE courier_locations (UPSERT)
    App->>DB: Supabase Realtime broadcast
    DB->>Buyer: Realtime subscription: courier-location
    Buyer->>App: Live map update
```

